{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>HostLens 是一款 Wi-Fi 掃描工具，可列出家中網絡已連線的裝置，並以名稱與類型標示可辨識的設備，適合想了解連線狀況、檢查網速問題或確認是否有陌生裝置加入的用戶。原價 US $0.99，現時<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-219.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>掌握連線裝置與網速狀況</h2>\n<p>HostLens 會掃描家中 Wi-Fi，列出已連線的電話、電腦、電視、打印機及智能插座，並標示最後掃描後新加入的裝置。用戶可查看上線狀態、IP 位址、製造商與開放連接埠，亦可為裝置命名或從清單移除。網絡檢查會量度路由器、互聯網與 DNS 的反應時間，以簡單文字解釋問題並提供嘗試步驟，另備 Ping 圖表、DNS 查詢與記錄匯出功能。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-264-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-265-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-266-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-267-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-268-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：HostLens: WiFi Device Scanner</li><li>應用類別：Utilities</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/hostlens-wifi-device-scanner/id6821962123?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>